'''Itchy Riches''' (ネーーーコボンボン, ''Nēēkobonbon'', '''Caaaat Bon Bon''') is a 1-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 4.4 Update|Version 4.4]].

==Effect==
Worker Cat Start Level UP (Sm): Worker Cat's initial level starts with +1.

==Combo==
