==Trivia==
*Itchy Riches' Japanese name, Nēēkobonbon, is a reference to the drawn-out "Bāākabonbon" from the [https://youtu.be/9XwOi-G3idE opening theme] of the anime [[wikipedia:Tensai Bakabon|''Tensai Bakabon'']]. [[Rich Cat III (Super Rare Cat)|Rich Cat Sr.]]'s design and Japanese name and description also heavily reference Bakabon's Papa, the main character of the series.

